<title>SINGAPORE: Omni Inudustries hits high of S$0.785.</title>
<headline>Omni Inudustries hits high of S$0.785.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electronics mould maker Omni Industries Ltd debut on Wednesday, hitting a high of Singapore $0.785 against its initial offer price of S$0.45.</p>
</text>
